# name: microsoft-outlook-mail
# priority: 4720
# section: microsoft
# description: Outlook 与 Exchange Online 邮箱入口
# boundary: 个人和工作邮箱、邮件协议与 Outlook 移动客户端分别按官方服务行提取。共享 Entra 登录独立，不展开租户占位字段，不采用同页 IP
# created-at: 2026-11-19T11:46:30Z
# updated-at: 2026-11-21T01:41:46Z
# source: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/enterprise/urls-and-ip-address-ranges
# source: https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/outlook/pop-imap-and-smtp-settings-for-outlook-com
# source: https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/outlook/getstarted/what-version-of-outlook-do-i-have
# canonical-rule-count: 10
# rule-count: 10
# format: quantumult-x
# canonical: rules/loon/4720-microsoft-outlook-mail.lsr

host,outlook.com,proxy
host,outlook.live.com,proxy
host,outlook.cloud.microsoft,proxy
host,outlook.office.com,proxy
host,outlook.office365.com,proxy
host,smtp.office365.com,proxy
host-suffix,acompli.net,proxy
host-suffix,outlookmobile.com,proxy
host-wildcard,*.mx.microsoft,proxy
host-wildcard,*.outlook.com,proxy
